{"id": "q_longmont_session_12_council_chamber_roster", "question": "Who's actually in the council chamber for the Session 12 fight with the Wolf?", "answer": "TL;DR: The chamber contains the Council members and multiple **Elite Corrupted Guards**, including **3–4 additional guards revealed by hidden doors behind council banners**; beyond that, the projection does not explicitly confirm other उपस्थित combatants (including the Wolf).\n\nBased on OBSERVED facts tied to the council chamber scene:\n- **Council (npc)**: Present in the **Council Chamber** during an active, high-tension emergency meeting with internal disagreement and time pressure.\n- **Elite Corrupted Guards (npc)**: Actively engaged as enemies in the chamber:\n  - Positioned along the walls / perimeter\n  - Reinforcements are **“3-4 additional corrupted elite guards… revealed by hidden doors behind council banners”**\n  - Entering via hidden passages and responding to alarms\n\nThere is **no explicit mention in the projection** confirming:\n- The Wolf’s physical presence in the chamber at that moment\n- Player characters or other named NPCs inside during the fight\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Location: Council Chamber (center of Mirathorn)\n- Defenses: Arcane locks, magical wards\n- Hidden Features: Doors behind council banners (used by corrupted guard reinforcements)\n- מצב: High tension, active conflict, guarded perimeter with ambush/reinforcement behavior\n\nIf you need exact positioning or initiative setup, the projection doesn’t provide that level of detail.", "has_error": false, "retrieval": {"enabled": true, "top_k": 30, "pre_filter_count": 2069, "post_filter_count": 30, "duration_ms": 53, "top_5": [["ent_council", 2.2944], ["ent_eirik", 1.8456], ["ent_the_wolf", 1.8456], ["ent_secret_escape_tunnel", 1.8], ["ent_torbin_jove", 1.7854]], "selected_entity_ids": ["ent_council", "ent_eirik", "ent_the_wolf", "ent_secret_escape_tunnel", "ent_torbin_jove", "ent_amulets_of_council", "ent_magic_pulse_alarms", "ent